 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "FileStorageSystem() starts empty. storeFile(file, date) records a file with a unique name and a \"yyyy-MM-dd\" date. getKthRecentFiles(k) returns the names of the min(k, stored) files first in order of date descending, then name ascending (code points). returnAllFiles() returns all names in insertion order. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
